### 1. GET Collection (Semua Data + Pagination) - SS 1
GET http://localhost/pemweb-obe/api/alats.php?page=1&limit=5

### 2. GET Single ID (Sukses & Not Found)
GET http://localhost/pemweb-obe/api/alats.php?id=1

### 3. CREATE (POST Data Valid - 201 Created) - SS 2 (Atas)
POST http://localhost/pemweb-obe/api/alats.php
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Raspberry Pi 4 Model B",
  "kategori": "Hardware",
  "jumlah": 5,
  "kondisi": "Baik"
}

### 4. CREATE (POST Data Invalid - 422 Validation Error) - SS 2 (Bawah)
POST http://localhost/pemweb-obe/api/alats.php
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "",
  "kategori": "Hardware",
  "jumlah": -3
}

### 5. UPDATE (PUT Data Valid - 200 OK) - SS 3
PUT http://localhost/pemweb-obe/api/alats.php?id=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Arduino Uno R3 (Updated)",
  "kategori": "Hardware",
  "jumlah": 12,
  "kondisi": "Baik"
}

### 6. GET Single IDTidak Ada (404 Not Found) - SS 4
GET http://localhost/pemweb-obe/api/alats.php?id=99999

### 7. DELETE (Sukses - 204 No Content)
DELETE http://localhost/pemweb-obe/api/alats.php?id=5